actual_result: "Release gate 301/301, zero skips; duplication zero; coverage 99.66 lines/94.07 branches/100 functions in four files, statements unmeasured. Strict health exit 0 after hash-only inherited history repair. Packed real tracker npm/native Bun pass, identical 185-node/330-edge graphs; scratch removed. GitHub preview dryRun true/wouldSync 0/skipped 1/planned 1. Production audit clean; full audit four high dev entries blocked by pm-graph-g8uc. CI and PR review pending."
