comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T10:53:56.533Z",codex-sol,"Isolated worktree from origin/main 1d47a84; consolidating Dependabot #118 #119 #120 #121. Open Dependabot alerts: zero. Preserve coverage ownership pm-graph-6zil; measure current gate without weakening thresholds."
  "2026-10-04T10:54:43.000Z",codex-sol,"Exact dev pins include CLI/pm-ops/pm-changelog 2026.10.4, jscpd 5.4.0, @types/node 26.6.4, eslint 10.12.0. Retained @babel/eslint-parser 8.0.5 because latest dist-tag 7.29.9 would downgrade the existing version. SDK floor remains 2026.8.7 because no new API is required."
  "2026-10-04T11:00:07.856Z",codex-sol,"Installed published CLI/ops/changelog 2026.10.4; copied canonical launcher byte-for-byte; scoped launcher tests 7/7 passed. Full npm audit uncovered transitive braces <=3.0.3 stack-exhaustion advisory GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm through fast-glob/micromatch, despite zero open GitHub alerts; resolving without downgrading pm-ops."
  "2026-10-04T11:00:55.749Z",codex-sol,"Security blocker tracked by pm-graph-g8uc. Full development audit cannot currently be clean because npm has no patched compatible braces release. Continue exact-head CI, real-tracker packed acceptance and read-only sync; report NOT READY unless a compatible fix becomes available."
  "2026-10-04T11:06:13.728Z",codex-sol,"Initial full linked release gate reproduced jscpd 5.4.0 failure: six clone pairs, 47/12152 duplicated lines (0.3868%) against unchanged 0%. Refactored shared entry guard, graph fixture nodes/path rows, Issue creation and real Neo4j retry loader state. Expanded measured sources to include shared main-invocation guard; existing behavior assertions retained."
  "2026-10-04T11:08:34.466Z",codex-sol,"Scoped analytics and docstring-entry regressions: node --test test/analytics.test.ts test/docstring-gate.test.ts passed 61/61, zero skips. Managed pm-github 2026.10.4 read-only preview: pm github sync --repo unbraind/pm-graph --dry-run => dryRun true, wouldSync 0, skipped 1, planned 1. No GitHub issues modified and scheduling unchanged."
  "2026-10-04T11:10:44.201Z",codex-sol,"Added real filesystem regression for new canonical launcher behavior: a node_modules file makes lookup inconclusive; preserve original MODULE_NOT_FOUND, reject ENOTDIR replacement or skip notice, and register no drivers. Scoped canonical launcher suite now 8/8 passed, zero skips."
  "2026-10-04T11:11:13.316Z",codex-sol,"Regression baseline proved against origin/main launcher in a disposable filesystem fixture: nonzero ENOTDIR replaced the resolution error (new assertion would fail). Published 2026.10.4 preserves MODULE_NOT_FOUND; scoped 8/8 passes. Canonical template remains unmodified."
  "2026-10-04T11:17:51.777Z",codex-sol,"Affected integration suite passed 12/12, zero skips. Duplication rerun reduced six pairs to one 8-line handler-invocation pair; shared only that invocation, preserving each scenario and every parity assertion. Full gate pending another serialized rerun."
  "2026-10-04T11:28:12.542Z",codex-sol,"Full linked coverage run was invalidated by the chosen tracker context: injected PM_PATH redirected fixture pm init away from its temporary cwd, so in-process handlers saw no fixture tracker. Scoped direct integration tests passed 12/12. Set linked release gate pm_context_mode=none to reproduce CI environment with disposable trackers. No fixture assertions or production code weakened."
  "2026-10-04T11:31:03.240Z",codex-sol,"PM test none/source is deliberately refused by CLI 2026.10.4. Preserve supported tracker/source isolation and clear only injected PM_PATH inside the authorized CI child command (env -u PM_PATH npm run release:check); retain sandboxed global context. Child environment preflight passed. This lets fixtures initialize their own cwd trackers, matching direct CI execution."
  "2026-10-04T11:39:13.805Z",codex-sol,"Corrected full run: 286/301 passed, zero skips; measured lines 99.66%, branches 94.07%, functions 100%. Remaining 15 failures reproduce CLI fail-closed incomplete local-directory install (10000-entry cap). Changed real contract fixture to pack declared built distribution once, install tarball via pm package install, and delete package scratch after suite; all command assertions retained."
  "2026-10-04T11:49:45.264Z",codex-sol,"Full release gate passes 301/301, no failures/skips; duplication 0/12116 lines, 50 sources, zero pairs; coverage 99.66 lines/94.07 branches/100 functions across four files (statements unmeasured). Strict health inherited history drift from merged #122 item pm-graph-3a1p; canonical dry-run and repair rehashed two of 19 entries, repaired/skipped zero patches, preserved provenance and byte-identical item, added audit marker. Verified repaired history; health now passes with two advisory stale-work warnings."
  "2026-10-04T11:51:40.245Z",codex-sol,"Packed real-tracker npm/native Bun acceptance passed: npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 ran pm-graph ping/export/analyze/cycles/cypher/critical-path/impact/path. Deep comparison (timestamps independently validated) matched 185 nodes and 330 edges, owner included. Scratch deleted. Durable exact commands/outputs and boundaries in docs/certification-2026.10.4.md. Health has one advisory finding covering two stale items."
